vintermann wrote:
> I've been experimenting with pacifist conduct, and I wonder what you
> guys who do it do to avoid starvation/angering your god. I get them to
> minetown, I even get lots of protection, but then I run out of food,
> and anger Hermes (or Thoth) when praying for sustenance.

Pray earlier--don't just eat food until you're out, and then pray.
Instead, alternate food/prayer when you get weak.  Gather lichen
corpses, which your early pet won't eat.  Buy the food in Minetown if
you need to.  Move faster, and get to Sokoban quickly once food is
running low.  Be fast, stand next to your pet when it's fighting, and
jump on the corpses before it does.  Blow an early wish on slow
digestion, or try to find/identify one.  Polymorph + polycontrol to
polymorph into your own race (resets hunger).

It's occasionally tricky in the early game, but after Sokoban you're
pretty much swimming in food for the rest of the game even without =SD.



